{"availability":"available","full":"romenkova/doska","name":"doska","description":"A local-first Kanban board that syncs across devices. Clean, lightweight, markdown-first.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":104,"forks":5,"created":"2026-06-16T22:19:23Z","updated":"2026-10-14T21:15:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://doska.sh","topics":["kanban","kanban-board","local-first","markdown","mcp","offline-first","pwa","react","self-hosting","task-management","tauri","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://app.doska.sh/d/welcome","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:29:38.881Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:29:38.881Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:29:38.881Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.782Z","stars":104,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:34.956Z","stars":104,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:12.574Z","stars":104,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-10T05:43:48.592Z","stars":104,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:29:38.881Z","stars":104,"forks":5}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Doska is in active development. Report bugs and request features.","I wanted a kanban app that is quick, Markdown-first, minimal, and still feature-rich. I couldn't find all of that in one app, so I made Doska.","Doska keeps everything in IndexedDB first, because it's fast and persistent. Then it syncs to a destination of your choice, a folder or a server, shortly after every change."],"features":["[x] Offline-first, local-first","[x] Markdown editor: syntax highlighting, tasks with a counter, slash menu","[x] Server to sync boards across devices","[x] Accounts: members, shared boards, public boards","[x] Local folder sync: boards and columns as folders, cards as Markdown files"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/romenkova/doska/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"81d2ea2d5f4b9cab9b72bce4d0023134e0224e18363167b2cfc288bcc3a37afe","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T20:16:41.881Z"},"overviewCh